{"id": "unknown-2026-09-11-022", "date": "2026-09-11", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 37, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["food_safety", "industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Sprout seed supplier recalled product amid outbreak", "content": "<p>The seed supplier behind a multi-state outbreak linked to sprouts may have been named quietly in an obscure FDA report.</p><p>First reported by Phyllis Entis on <a href=\"https://efoodalert.com/2026/09/10/alfalfa-seeds-implicated-in-outbreak-of-e-coli-and-salmonella-recalled/?ref=foodsafetynews.com\"><u>eFoodAlert.com</u></a>, the news about International Sprout Holdings Inc. of Cookeville, TN, came in an entry on the Food and Drug Administration&#x2019;</p>", "sources": [{"name": "food_safety_news", "url": "https://www.foodsafetynews.com/2026/09/sprout-seed-supplier-recalled-product-amid-outbreak/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-09-11-023", "date": "2026-09-11", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 37, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["food_safety", "industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Peanuts recalled because of Salmonella contamination", "content": "<p>PK brand Roasted Lemon N&#x2019; Chilli Peanuts are being recalled in Canada because of Salmonella contamination.</p><p>The peanuts were distributed in Ontario and Quebec, according to the Canadian Food Inspection Agency.</p><p>As of the posting of the recall notice, no illnesses had been reported in relation to the recalled</p>", "sources": [{"name": "food_safety_news", "url": "https://www.foodsafetynews.com/2026/09/peanuts-recalled-because-of-salmonella-contamination/", "type": "rss"}]}
